hen explain the story\'s meaning: the key symbolizes a change in perspective, not a literal key. Elena was stuck in routine; the key made her notice what she already had. The mysterious filling of the jar shows she started seeing the beauty around her. Then say that if they\'d prefer a different story (more straightforward or more dramatic), I can tell another. Also ask if they want clarification on any specific part.'}, 'logprobs': None, 'finish_reason': 'stop'}], 'usage': {'prompt_tokens': 1249, 'completion_tokens': 437, 'total_tokens': 1686, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'cached_tokens': 640}, 'completion_tokens_details': {'reasoning_tokens': 253}, 'prompt_cache_hit_tokens': 640, 'prompt_cache_miss_tokens': 609}, 'system_fingerprint': 'fp_a18b46594c_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402'}"}
